                        text "Direct sibling of defects.test-command-feature-coverage, which was fixed by adding the seven headless-safe features to the test command. The lint command has the identical hole and was not fixed at the same time: `cargo clippy --no-deps -p markdawn -p markdawn-graphviz --all-targets -- -D warnings` runs under default features (highlight-all-languages), so every module behind ansi, terminal, dioxus, pikchr, graphviz, typst, serde or tracey is compiled out and never linted. Adding the same feature set surfaces 12 pre-existing clippy errors in src/adapter/typst.rs, src/svg_sanitize.rs, src/svg_text_to_paths.rs, src/typst/world.rs and src/typst/mod.rs — single_char_add_str, collapsible_if, needless_borrow, useless_conversion, assertions_on_constants. None are new; they have simply never been visible to the gate. Fixing means clearing those 12 first, then extending the lint command to match the test command's feature set, otherwise the gate goes red on landing. Note the iced features stay out of both commands (iced-app needs a window and GPU surface), so iced remains unlinted by design and carries its own known clippy debt. Surfaced by the agent fixing defects.uikit-diagram-engine-output-unsanitised, which ran clippy with features on to check its own work."
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-07-29T22:57:05.912034Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @note
                        text "Widened to absorb the retired defects.iced-excluded-from-gate. Full scope now: (1) clear the 12 pre-existing clippy errors that the seven headless-safe features expose in src/adapter/typst.rs, src/svg_sanitize.rs, src/svg_text_to_paths.rs, src/typst/world.rs and src/typst/mod.rs — single_char_add_str, collapsible_if, needless_borrow, useless_conversion, assertions_on_constants; (2) clear the 17 pre-existing lints under --features iced in src/adapter/iced/render.rs and selectable.rs — explicit_counter_loop, collapsible_if, field_reassign_with_default, one dead_code; (3) add the seven features plus iced to the lint command in .config/nplan/config.styx; (4) add iced to the test command, which currently misses 36 tests written for iced rules plus every pre-existing iced test. Order matters: clear the lints before extending the commands, or the gate goes red on landing. iced-app stays out of both — it needs a window and a GPU surface, unlike iced."
